	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9739"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=748" title="View the profile of Iniquitous">Iniquitous</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 12<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=748"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9739#msg9739"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9739#msg9739">Re: LDON drama 4 j00</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #22 on:</b> August 04, 2004, 04:04:34 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							In reference to zoning in early...<br />Well, I just disagree with this mindset.&nbsp; If I really don&#039;t like how a group is being lead, I leave.&nbsp; Otherwise, I do what I&#039;m told since I&#039;m not leading.&nbsp; It&#039;s common practice to wait for everyone to be ready before zoning in.&nbsp; I assume I&#039;m supposed to wait unless the leader actually tells the group to zone in asap.<br /><br />In reference to the CC or lack there of or disagreement with...etc...<br />In this instance, if the multiple pulls were causing near wipes every time, there was every reason to expect people to object to it and take action to stop it.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9740"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=146" title="View the profile of simplee">simplee</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 127<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/devil1.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								smoked again................    ranger down!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=146"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9740#msg9740"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9740#msg9740">Re: LDON drama 4 j00</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #23 on:</b> August 04, 2004, 04:54:00 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							&quot;In this instance, if the multiple pulls were causing near wipes every time, there was every reason to expect people to object to it and take action to stop it.&quot; - Iniquitous<br /><br />The problem with multiple pulls wasn&#039;t the number of mobs... it was that people weren&#039;t doing their job.&nbsp; If the ranger had half the talent he thought he had, he would have considered root parking the additional mobs away from the tank, and taken one mob on at a time, if it was really that big of an issue.&nbsp; Seriously, people do adventures without mezzers all the time... it&#039;s not that big of a deal.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Huntress Simplee Mee<br />66 Forest Stalker
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9741"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=748" title="View the profile of Iniquitous">Iniquitous</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 12<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=748"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9741#msg9741"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9741#msg9741">Re: LDON drama 4 j00</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #24 on:</b> August 04, 2004, 05:17:16 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							That&#039;s a reasonable question.&nbsp; However, with a bard pulling, if the group can&#039;t handle more than one at a time, why pull multiples?&nbsp; The bard should be able to paci pull most of the time, right?&nbsp; Doesn&#039;t pulling multiples needlessly put the group in harm&#039;s way when you know the group can&#039;t handle them?&nbsp; If ranger&#039;s root is as resistable as dru root, root CC&#039;ing adds is hardly preferable to just single pulling in the first place.&nbsp; At least, that&#039;s the way I see it.&nbsp; <br /><br />I really think this was just a case of very different mindsets clashing.&nbsp; You have one person who regards the activity as trivial and to be done in as little time as possible.&nbsp; You have at least one person who has no real clue about anything (pally).&nbsp; You have X people left over who would rather take more time and do things more safely given their less-than-perfect tank and healer.<br /><br />I would wager, if the bard had simply said &quot;I&#039;m going to pull mobs as quickly as possible.&nbsp; Please park them as necessary.&quot; at the beginning, everybody (everybody that was capable anyway) would have dealt with it and been reasonably happy.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9742"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=15" title="View the profile of Killy">Killy</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Goddess of Whips and Rezzes<br />
								Global Moderator<br />
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 427<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://home.comcast.net/~nlfalkowski/ss/clericanim02.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/KillyCirce" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="KillyCirce" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://edit.yahoo.com/config/send_webmesg?.target=Lepredes"><img src="http://opi.yahoo.com/online?u=Lepredes&amp;m=g&amp;t=0" alt="Lepredes" border="0" /></a>
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=15"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.echoesineternity.org/" title="EIE" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9742#msg9742"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9742#msg9742">Re: LDON drama 4 j00</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #25 on:</b> August 04, 2004, 05:21:58 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Since when did they have leaders for ldon adv?  I thought this was a group, not follow the leader.  <br />I guess I never got to play that because I have never been on a easy ldon where there was a leader,<br />it has always been a group effort.  So where you keep comming up with this leader stuff is beyond me.<br />Who exactly was the leader?  Oh and how do you keep saying it was the bard with the attitude?  It was <br />definitely the other guy with the attitude.  Hello...................you talk to me or boss me around like that <br />in a easy ldon, I would claim attitude too........... And for shits sakes, why are you all throwing a fit over a <br />easy LDON?  Just leave and find another group, don&#039;t sit around and subject yourselves to whose cock is bigger than <br />the others.  <br /><br />Anyways, my 2cp.................................GOOD LUCK.......... <br /><br />Pss........................If you think the bard has attitude, you should never group with me !!!!!!!!!<br /><br />Oh why are we not hearing from the 2 (ranger and pally)?&nbsp; Why are we hearing from the friend who is hearing handmedown rumor?
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><div align="center"><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=1100304" target="_blank"><img src="http://kilaer.tripod.com/sitebuildercontent/sitebuilderpictures/kilaer-1.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a><br /><span style="color: Teal;">What we do in life, &quot;Echoes in Eternity&quot;</span></div>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
