	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9744"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=748" title="View the profile of Iniquitous">Iniquitous</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 12<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=748"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9744#msg9744"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9744#msg9744">Re: LDON drama 4 j00</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #27 on:</b> August 04, 2004, 05:48:02 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Well, you&#039;re saying that a group is 6 individuals, where as I regard it as 5 team members with a team leader.&nbsp; If you&#039;re invited to join a group, you&#039;re invited to do what that group is doing, not necessarily what you want to do.<br /><br />I think there&#039;s a big issue here with people expecting to be able to let everyone make their own decisions, yet openly admitting that many pickup ldons are full of unknown quantities.&nbsp; If everyone is unfamiliar with everyone else, how could they possibly all make simultaneous decisions and not come up with a chaotic result?&nbsp; There is no one right way to do anything, and you can&#039;t expect everyone to come up with the same answer to a problem.&nbsp; Root parking adds might seem obvious to some, but others might consider that they might actually be waking mezzed adds by the time the root hits (a lot of druid roots do dmg, for instance).<br /><br />On a lot of the pickup ldons I get into, you can&#039;t even depend on people to notice they&#039;re taking damage from a rooted add before they&#039;re nearly dead.<br /><br />As far as the ranger (I do not know the pally) replying, I personally hope he never reads this thread.&nbsp; I do not believe the outcome would be constructive.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9745"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=744" title="View the profile of zigak">zigak</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 13<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=744"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9745#msg9745"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9745#msg9745">Re: LDON drama 4 j00</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #28 on:</b> August 04, 2004, 05:55:24 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Iniqitous,<br /><br />If you would have read my post (and believe me I&#039;m not faulting you for not reading it, it was a bore fest) you would have seen that I wasn&#039;t pulling multipes, I would pull one then wait until the current mob was low health and go pull another.&nbsp; All singles, the reason we got a 3 pull in the first place was because I didn&#039;t want to kill the wizard.&nbsp; Just though I would clear that up.&nbsp; <br /><br />I really don&#039;t give a shit anymore, was frusterating at the time but whatever.&nbsp; I was adjusting my stradegy for the group, FYI.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
