									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #29 on:</b> August 04, 2004, 05:59:15 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							It&#039;s cool.&nbsp; I have this issue with not being able to stop myself from replying.&nbsp; You&#039;ve probably noticed on this thead.&nbsp; Hehe.&nbsp; I&#039;ll stop now.<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />
